OL,3,GNEWSAProlific burglar who stole #500k
OL,4,Aof valuables jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who stole more than #500,000
OL,7,Fworth of high value items including
OL,8,Fdesigner bags and jewellery from nine
OL,9,Fproperties across four counties has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed after his DNA was found on
OL,11,Fa bottle of antibacterial spray used to
OL,12,Fclean a scene.
OL,14,FDionis Doku, 45, emptied jewellery
OL,15,Fboxes and stole from a safe cupboard in
OL,16,Fburglaries across London, Kent, Surrey,
OL,17,Fand Buckinghamshire from October 2025
OL,18,Fto February 2026.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
