OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProlific burglar who stole #500k
OL,4,Aof valuables jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoku, of no fixed address, was caught
OL,7,Fafter leaving glove marks and DNA at a
OL,8,Fburglary in Sevenoaks which matched
OL,9,Fscenes in Ashford, Putney in London,
OL,10,Fand Virginia Water in Surrey, Kent
OL,11,FPolice say.
OL,13,FHe was sentenced to three years and 10
OL,14,Fmonths in prison at Harrow Crown Court
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
